  "featureBookingGateDesc": "Every booking surface — plan, day, week and month views, the booking sheet, the kiosk, a QR or NFC scan — checks the availability parameters before offering a window and names the reason when it cannot; closed days draw as closed in every view, a legend names the seat states, and admins may check members out where the policy allows.",
