  "featureExpenseRepartitionDesc": "A shared expense (a cleaning bill, an internet upgrade, a broken chair) split over the members — equal shares, pro rata of the subscription, pro rata of usage, or a key per member — with every share previewed before it is booked. The shares land as charge lines on the next usage invoice; a reversal books credit notes. Through the validation rules. Off: no distribution.",
