  "featureInvoiceJourneyDesc": "Every invoice shows where it stands — Issued, Payment, Confirmation, Closed — and whose move it is: the member pays, an admin confirms the declared payment, the issuer matches it, the validators decide. The issuers' hub adds a stage strip with live counts and a How-it-works explainer.",
  "featureInvoiceJourneyTitle": "The journey of an invoice",
  "featureInvoicePdfTemplate": "Invoice PDF template",
  "featureInvoicePdfTemplateDesc": "Owner-written intro and footer text on the invoice PDF. Never touches the e-invoice XML.",
  "featureInvoiceSettlementDesc": "Several of a member's open invoices can be regrouped into one they pay. The originals stay in the archive, traceable position by position, and stop being chased separately.",
  "featureInvoiceSettlementTitle": "Regroup invoices",
  "featureInvoicing": "Invoices",
