  },
  "featureInvoicingWizardDesc": "One guided month-close process for the finance person: a start-of-month run for the subscriptions paid ahead and an end-of-month run for usage and extra charges — review, issue in one batch, send, remind what is due, register and validate payments, match them to invoices, regroup, write off or refund, and a summary with whose move is left. Off: the separate screens.",
  "featureInvoicingWizardTitle": "Invoicing wizard",
  "featureKioskMemberPhotosDesc": "The kiosk receipt shows the member's profile photo — the visual wrong-badge check.",
