  "featurePriceNegotiationsDesc": "The tariff is the default; a member can hold their own conditions — monthly fee, overage rate, discount on supplements, unit prices per service and package, the occupation percentage — proposed by whoever holds Manage commercial agreements and validated by the rules. Seen by the member, the owners and the holders of View commercial agreements; every read is logged.",
  "featurePriceNegotiationsTitle": "Price negotiations",
  "featurePublicHolidaysDesc": "An owner picks a year and sees the public holidays that would become closure days, then confirms. Re-running a year adds nothing, and a month that already carries an invoice is skipped and named — generating holidays never changes a bill that was already issued.",
