  "featureRecordingPrivacyDesc": "For filming or photographing this workspace. Every name, e-mail, telephone number, address and photograph is replaced by an invented person before it reaches the screen, while the plan, the bookings and the figures stay the real ones. A banner says so on every screen, and the identity forms refuse to save until it is off.",
