  "featureVatGroupsDesc": "Each VAT rate carries the fiscal group of what it taxes — standard, intermediate, reduced, super-reduced, zero, exempt, not subject, refundable deposit, excise-bearing — with the category and the exemption reason the group implies. Off: bare percentages.",
  "@featureVatGroupsDesc": {
